      "interviewScript": "These four questions are the coloured dots of the original paper instrument: information, practical help, feelings, and spiritual connection. Each is asked about every person on the map, family and non-family alike.\n\nAll the people are placed automatically so the participant reads the map rather than arranging it. Answer the first question about who knows whom before the four exchange questions — the connections make the later views legible.",
